                <head>21. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On March 20, Ambassador Dillon gave a major speech to the Diplomatic Press
                    Association of Paris on United States policy toward French North Africa. The
                    text of his speech is printed in Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, April 2, 1956, pages 553–555.</p>
            </div>
